  "hindi": "यदि तुम मुक्ति चाहते हो, हे तात, विषयों को विष के समान त्याग दो; क्षमा, सरलता, दया, शुचिता, सत्य को अमृत के समान पी लो।",
  "english": "If you desire liberation, dear one, abandon sense-objects like poison; drink forgiveness, uprightness, compassion, purity, truth like nectar.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "The Sanskrit has no 'and' between the five virtues; the first four are one dvandva compound, satyam stands beside it, so the translations list them without a connective.",
  "confidence": "high",
  "type": "verse",
  "line_ids": [
