  "hindi": "जो नराधम एक-दूसरे के मर्मों को बोलते हैं, वे ही विनाश को प्राप्त होते हैं, बाँबी के भीतर के साँप के समान।",
  "english": "The lowest of men who speak of one another's vulnerable points, they indeed go to destruction, like a snake in the belly of an anthill.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "marman = a vital or vulnerable point; rendered literally, without adding 'reveal'. valmīkodara-sarpa-vat = 'like the snake in the anthill's interior'.",
